sequenceDiagram
  participant Page as React page
  participant Redux as Redux thunk/slice
  participant Axios as Service/Axios
  participant Express
  participant Auth as protect middleware
  participant Controller
  participant Mongoose
  participant MongoDB
  Page->>Redux: dispatch feature operation
  Redux->>Axios: call service
  Axios->>Axios: attach Bearer token + credentials
  Axios->>Express: HTTP request
  Express->>Auth: route middleware
  Auth->>Mongoose: verify JWT then load User
  Mongoose->>MongoDB: user lookup
  MongoDB-->>Auth: user
  Auth->>Controller: req.user + request
  Controller->>Mongoose: feature query/update
  Mongoose->>MongoDB: database operation
  MongoDB-->>Controller: result
  Controller-->>Axios: JSON/status
  Axios-->>Redux: result or error
  Redux-->>Page: updated view state
